{"id":"gana","lemma":"gana","pos":"noun","rank":1055,"glosses":["best translated with to feel like, to want","urge, uses a \"tengo ganas de\" or \"me dan ganas de\" construction"],"ipa":"/ˈɡana/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ganas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-gana.wav","formAudio":{"ganas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-ganas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La confianza se gana.","en":"Trust is earned.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442253"},{"text":"Tengo ganas de llorar.","en":"I want to cry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440390"},{"text":"Tom gana mucho dinero.","en":"Tom makes big money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800843"},{"text":"Tenía ganas de llorar.","en":"I felt like crying.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450586"},{"text":"Gana 300.000 yenes al mes.","en":"He earns 300,000 yen a month.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586958"}]}